OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSA'Storm Boelo had #50k impact on
OL,4,Aour farm'
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo sisters have spoken of the
OL,7,F"catastrophic" #50,000 impact Storm
OL,8,FBoelo caused to their farm.
OL,10,FAli and Fiona Wilshaw, who run Bates
OL,11,FFarm in Risley, Warrington, Cheshire,
OL,12,Fwere expecting to welcome about 1,000
OL,13,Fcars for pumpkin picking on Sunday, but
OL,14,Fwere instead forced to cancel their
OL,15,Fevent as instead they cleared up the
OL,16,Fdestruction left by heavy rain and
OL,17,F50mph (80km/h) winds.
OL,19,FThe impact from the storm had been
OL,20,F"pretty unprecedented," Ali said,
OL,21,Fadding that it had been a sleepless
OL,22,Fnight.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,407,400,260,160,0,100
