OL,3,GNEWSA'Storm Boelo had #50k impact on
OL,4,Aour farm'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"We were up at 05:00 GMT doing a site
OL,7,Ftour of the destruction. We've got a
OL,8,Fmarquee and a fair few gazebos from the
OL,9,Ffood vendors, which are absolutely just
OL,10,Fobliterated."
